# GUNC reference databases (DIAMOND .dmnd files), e.g. installed with the
# GUNC data manager or with
#
#   gunc download_db -db progenomes_2.1 /path/to/gunc_db/
#
# Keep the original file name (e.g. gunc_db_progenomes2.1.dmnd): GUNC derives
# the database type and the taxonomy to use from it.
#
# Columns (TAB-separated):
# <value>	<name>	<version>	<path>
#
# <version> is the GUNC version that downloaded the database.
#
#progenomes_2.1	GUNC proGenomes 2.1 (downloaded 2026-11-23)	1.1.1	/data/gunc/progenomes_2.1/gunc_db_progenomes2.1.dmnd
